## Why This Is Asked
Tests knowledge of non-blocking data structures, ABA avoidance, memory ordering, and NUMA-aware performance under mixed-priority traffic. It also touches on backpressure and practical microbenchmark design.

## Key Concepts
- Lock-free design and ABA avoidance with per-slot sequence counters
- Memory ordering: release on enqueue, acquire on dequeue
- NUMA-aware layout and cache-line alignment
- Priority routing, backpressure metrics, and spillover handling
